{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9b07bcb7b72b4b7dc902a02def6344dc3360c363821ede639c0e2141ea496b1d", "ja": "リアルドッキリ企画！　試される友情！", "zh": "真实的整蛊企划！经受考验的友情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "683ecee2128c8437c2b0e42b4933794be56954e301adf6f9c8868ccc3877e5b2", "ja": "番組第2回では、普段アイドル達が友達に\nどう接しているかの検証VTRが流れる。\nそれぞれ友達から忍耐力を試されるも、\nそれぞれが違う形で、友達を大切にしている\n様子が映し出されるのだった。", "zh": "在节目第2集中，将播放一段验证影像，展示偶像们平时是如何与朋友相处的。\n虽然她们分别被朋友考验了忍耐力，但影像中展现了她们以各自不同的方式珍视朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1000_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "10d0a7b7ab7cb6e7656bb9dd7afae7292538919025275de42834f2275fb029dc", "ja": "さて、本日も765プロの皆さんと楽しい時間を\n過ごしていこうと思うわけですが……。", "zh": "那么，今天也要和765事务所的各位一起度过愉快的时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1001_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "8c2b3e4a9679ea78e033f27b349ebaf3e3869d4f5e061946487d5d958ead98ea", "ja": "リアルドッキリ企画！　試される友情ーっ！", "zh": "真实整蛊企划！考验友情——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "e29605e5e7dcec44752bd0d6df038dba0ae1e010af029413652bc936a75fd36d", "ja": "わーっ！", "zh": "哇—！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e29605e5e7dcec44752bd0d6df038dba0ae1e010af029413652bc936a75fd36d", "ja": "わーっ！", "zh": "哇—！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "e29605e5e7dcec44752bd0d6df038dba0ae1e010af029413652bc936a75fd36d", "ja": "わーっ！", "zh": "哇—！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "e50a6e190a23024f7239f7ccaf6ffb0f3841021f54138526c79a23e45a176d46", "ja": "パチパチパチ……！", "zh": "啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1006_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "edcf220012126adeacc77721c5d57870106883d0468a236583405bf146eac8c1", "ja": "アイドルにとっても、普段の友人関係は大切なもの。", "zh": "对偶像来说，平时的朋友关系也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1007_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "43e7cd0d5e129d6e1ecc78f388464feb903e2e2f3291dccd5f2eced872a875f6", "ja": "今回はそのお友達の皆さんに協力を仰ぎ、\nドッキリを仕掛ける企画です。", "zh": "这次的企划是请求那位朋友们的协助，策划一场惊喜恶作剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "0c33a337f661de216084852814b1edb1265a9d66dfd1e17ee7be822851cb99a7", "ja": "うーん……控えめに言って、鬼☆だね！　この企画を\n考えた人は、反省文を書いて茜ちゃんに提出だ！", "zh": "嗯……往轻了说，这简直是魔鬼☆啊！策划这个企划的人，写一份检讨书交给小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1009_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "7bfdc3a229a2f5f6952c1b76ca59fa60c52b0265c8bc3b9051d5055eeb96e006", "ja": "実はもう、収録は済んでいるんです。\nまずは、所さんから！", "zh": "其实录音已经完成了。\n首先从所同学开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "e6320bd687005a34b1783f1cf53b9a9ee40284506846db65c58e5da03c62e9b0", "ja": "にゃはは♪　それでは、\nこちらの映像をご覧ください！　どうぞ～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪那么，请观看这段影像！请——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1011_narration", "source_sha256": "1ff23b39373600339b8b77e4dc80acb1cf458df74f368d1db869e1c1cef6979b", "ja": "『友達で集まって、ショッピングモールに\nやってきた所さん。そこで……？』", "zh": "和朋友们一起来到购物中心的所惠美。在那里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1012_yuujina", "source_sha256": "91be604fa8f1c376c01e333647f434c0a1a96b1bc9c8336d693dea4f957cb59e", "ja": "ゴメーン、トイレ行きたくなっちゃった。\n恵美、ちょっとこれキープしといてくれる？", "zh": "抱歉——我突然想上厕所了。\n惠美，能帮我先拿一下这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a40d8a89a4fa2984681fa4935903bf40a491f398ea2ab9ae2a23cdfe567f069", "ja": "オッケー！　見といたげるから、行っといで～。\n……って、デカッ！？　なにこれ、重いし！", "zh": "好——！我帮你看着，你去吧～  \n……等等，好大！？这是什么啊，又大又重！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1014_yuujinb", "source_sha256": "08de56caa5652b5eab70f1bb4ee293e5661e51af67797982bc736a31f1e72900", "ja": "ねえ恵美、このお菓子買おうか迷ってるんだけど、\n試食して感想聞かせてよ。ほら、あーん！", "zh": "喂，惠美，我正在犹豫要不要买这个点心，  \n你先尝尝，告诉我感想吧。来，啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "70564531bdc51676e5a8181c6ead1ce71b8d70effa0a59fa333a928feca4728b", "ja": "えっ？　う、うん……パクッ！　もぐもぐ……。\nおー、めっちゃ美味しいじゃん♪　買いっしょ。", "zh": "咦？　嗯、嗯……啊呜！　嚼嚼……  \n哦——超好吃的嘛♪　买它吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1016_yuujinc", "source_sha256": "c50917b8a5b57ef9b993f9a9be0c01754234f043d3a9b715032e791e2b2abf2e", "ja": "いたいた、恵美～！　このボディミスト、どう思う？\nちょっと匂い嗅いでみて！", "zh": "找到你了，惠美～！你觉得这款身体喷雾怎么样？\n来闻闻看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1017_yuujind", "source_sha256": "75360cad1d3e758ca755026a5163851fd7b61c5129b96947288e3c9dd4cb179f", "ja": "ねえねえ、このアイシャドウの発色が見たいんだけど、\n恵美で試させて！　ほら、動かないでね～……。", "zh": "喂喂，我想看看这款眼影上色后的效果，  \n让我在惠美身上试试！来，别动哦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "118ae852a6f4654d36e6be02e269085033abc4f8eda6c8ea5bd2944a7c80480b", "ja": "えーっ！？　クンクン……おっ、いい香り……。\nえっ、動くな？　ごめんごめん……ズレちゃった？", "zh": "诶——！？ 嗅嗅……哦，好香啊……  \n诶，不要动？ 抱歉抱歉……是不是涂歪了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1019_narration", "source_sha256": "5f843238196818f6e888cdcacb747df7e3cf1944607ee8862aff64e7b7343d38", "ja": "『友達の頼みを一つも断らない所さん。\nそのうち、凄い事になってきてしまった……』", "zh": "『从不拒绝朋友请求的所小姐。\n不知不觉间，事情变得不得了起来……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1020_yuujina", "source_sha256": "9d189d7e470ad6111f300754f32f706b5a35f837699faaab0a69323204f6d77b", "ja": "ねえ、この縄跳び買おうか迷ってるんだけど、\n恵美、そのままちょっと跳んでみてよ。", "zh": "那个，我正在犹豫要不要买这根跳绳，惠美，你就这样先跳一下试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "a9594bb145f8208ceaabfe0c5563f87323fef4c625cab40a26d52282ebb6e571", "ja": "待って待って、それはさすがにおかしくない！？\n……ドッキリでしょ、これ！？", "zh": "等等等等，这也太奇怪了吧！？\n……这是整蛊对吧，绝对是吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1022_narration", "source_sha256": "e3dc74a1ddde05fd21afdec9e1aca3507450335742ca8b86d4326f902a4217a6", "ja": "『……というワケで最後はバレてしまいましたが、\n所さんの器の大きさのわかった一日でした！』", "zh": "『……事情就是这样，虽然最后还是败露了，\n但这也是让人体会到了所小姐心胸宽广的一天！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "a8bf8d6ab027c56710cb68d7db02b33c536de657cf554545bb6c7870106cef1b", "ja": "んも～っ！　よくもやってくれたな～！？\n今度、ドリンクバーおごらせてやるっ！", "zh": "真是的～！亏你们干得出来啊～！？\n下次一定要让你们请我喝自助饮料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1024_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "d7ec55ee9678b2e077cfe0cdc402fc410d9b84b619c0eea47a1d25506d27bf80", "ja": "何でも引き受けてくれすぎて、心配になりますね。\n気を付けてくださいね……さて、お次は？", "zh": "什么都答应得太爽快了，真让人有些担心。\n请多加小心哦……那么，接下来要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "8eed8d926133821fe0297d2ba7dc515a9ec2120c45b6a5a6c6d99501f59996b7", "ja": "はいはーい！　みんなお待ちかね、茜ちゃんです☆\nそれではVTRぅ、スタートォーッ！", "zh": "好嘞好嘞！大家等候已久的小茜来啦☆\n那么，VTR——开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "57bdd411b1ee1d78eeb4ec74d22ab2cd888e897f08566f0d0bae74aad819b65b", "ja": "ふんふんふふーん♪　ふふふふーん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼哼♪　哼哼哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1027_narration", "source_sha256": "9265f478ae9deb6e52c44c1423ae2cd6235a028828523630dc74b36ce3bd1396", "ja": "『野々原さん、上機嫌。それは、一日限定10食の\nプレミアムプリンが買えたから……』", "zh": "『野野原小姐心情大好。那是因为买到了每日限量10份的\n高级布丁……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1028_kurasumeito", "source_sha256": "df645bc6d62ea97c044fc496fef5ae7b779e6efdb6f27e5e7f7b58285f524109", "ja": "うぅ……はぁ……。", "zh": "呜……哈啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "e2217c1a5a3535e535aca88ed2f7c1e778055dcb353bf90c755949523307a68d", "ja": "おやおや？　どうしたのかネ、君ぃ。切なげなため息を\nついて、茜ちゃんのことでも考えていたのかニャ？", "zh": "哎呀呀？这是怎么了呀，你——叹着这么惆怅的气，是在想小茜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1030_kurasumeito", "source_sha256": "cccde3e7e4144f217dc56e6f074e26810c590a42c223f236a507c604ddb5c0d2", "ja": "う、ううん……今日、ちょっとバタバタしてて、\nお昼ご飯、食べられなくて……お腹空いちゃったんだ。", "zh": "没、没有啦……今天有点手忙脚乱的，\n没能吃上午饭……肚子就饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c1e2562a91984c5f845942c1b46c34e603b5b179c146954825beaed55a82577", "ja": "う、うぐっ！？", "zh": "呜、呜哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1032_kurasumeito", "source_sha256": "b877151ff7e00fc8bc5f959ba34ee36248ab0753282ca288963f2bffe2cd20dd", "ja": "私、ちょっと貧血気味だし、ちょっとでも何か\n食べておきたかったな……購買、売り切れちゃってて。", "zh": "我有点贫血，想着哪怕吃点什么也好……结果学校小卖部都卖完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "fb90b611f1dc638887c537e37aa463ea6c099e437649180c6ec66bb1f771b9f6", "ja": "う、うぐ、ぐぐぐぅ……プリンの、神よ……。\nこれが……これが、試練……！？", "zh": "呜、呜呃、呃呃呃……布丁之、神啊……\n难道这就是……这就是，试炼吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "673ac5cee33c1d4775a60626f24bf65711829ce98eec118e63c5efa308979f02", "ja": "……おおーっと！　こんなところに偶然、\nおいしいプリンが！？　さあ、これをお食べ！", "zh": "……哦——！居然这么巧，在这种地方发现了美味的布丁！？来，快吃这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1035_kurasumeito", "source_sha256": "dbe2afd422e690faff31519e552c901e30818fdc29145268974b5ec6a350e369", "ja": "えっ、あ、ありがとう！　でも……野々原さん、\nプリン大好きだよね？　もらっちゃっていいの……？", "zh": "诶，谢谢你！不过……野野原同学，\n你很喜欢布丁吧？我真的可以收下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "2542bf737fdd48a7919282a921d62b4a681da91e40dce66e5f7a1c359f6487a4", "ja": "そ、そう言われるとやっぱり返……いや、いいから\n早く食べて！　茜ちゃんの理性が残っているうちに！", "zh": "你、你这么一说，我果然还是该还回……不，别管了，快点吃！趁着小茜的理智还在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1037_narration", "source_sha256": "155381367815400b1ec187440035a0b3040867c26b5c832f891da9a59e87507d", "ja": "『限定プリンは失ったけど……もっと大切なものを\n手に入れた、野々原さんなのでした』", "zh": "『虽然失去了限定布丁……但野野原小姐得到了更加珍贵的东西』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "d6c6e380e3dbe5f481b882f29588dcc8fc8765d9983ecd9c662fa425710ab70f", "ja": "いやいやいや！　いい話風にまとめてるけど、\n許されないからね！？　限定プリンだからね！？", "zh": "不不不！别装作在总结什么感人故事，绝对不能原谅你哦！？那可是限定布丁啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1039_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "9144024a94c81b013d4cbdce8a8862bb78666f02453efc2a7e3a4648d326b792", "ja": "お任せください。野々原さんへのギャラは、\n全額プリンでお支払いする準備があるそうです。", "zh": "请放心。听说已经准备好用布丁全额支付给野野原小姐的酬劳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "00dbb703dad464d54dadd2232bfe1da2e7c2cb69623dd2ddf4a1488bf251b3fc", "ja": "ウニャッ！？　それはいくらなんでも……\nい、いや……ワンチャン、アリか？　アリなのか？", "zh": "呜喵！？　这未免也太过分了……\n不、不对……说不定有机会？真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1041_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "976b188bc51d343294e39023e55cdda2b9d3ab1abc20d950d89ef1ed8314bcc7", "ja": "さて。最後は、高山さんです！", "zh": "那么最后是高山小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "e16630f46eefe6deb2e9b101824d8b7e336755c33385fc5131b1b5acabf70700", "ja": "はい！　ドッキリを見てもらうのって、なんだか\n緊張しますね……では、ご覧ください！", "zh": "好的！要让大家看整蛊节目，总觉得有点紧张呢……那么，请看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1043_narration", "source_sha256": "b976cd0f1caa00b3195d26236846f92c2076e1d400dff9c37342ce2de5f30158", "ja": "『オフの日、友達と待ち合わせをしている高山さん。\nでも、相手がなかなかやってきません……』", "zh": "『休息日，高山同学正和朋友碰头。\n但是，对方却迟迟没有出现……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1044_027say", "source_sha256": "c5d9ae6148a03a24391937fdebe374e58fcf11fdf4d3840b6046ec0dd76be519", "ja": "遅いな……。\n既読もつかないし、どうしたんだろ？", "zh": "真慢啊……。消息也没显示已读，到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1045_narration", "source_sha256": "c9bd535f9dc548e0e82f9b056fa25ed7df3b58f76168540f6b96d16925b7f41f", "ja": "『15分、経過……』", "zh": "『已过去15分钟……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "fb10766b5e10031f18e10147ec4f8b913f500b85849d0035d9758db1e26162d7", "ja": "ん～……ここの振り付け、難しいんだよね。\nみんなよく踊れるなぁ、もっと練習しないと……。", "zh": "嗯～……这里的舞步很难呢。\n大家都能跳得这么好，真厉害啊，我还得多练习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1047_narration", "source_sha256": "ce13064a4bddde29bb57440bc896e73bf460420f665d63ec682748793b4eed2c", "ja": "『30分、経過……』", "zh": "『已过去30分钟……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1048_027say", "source_sha256": "70864e50ff610f5ca2d2f8eb832d4bc6c536aca415b709662f2b87df26867551", "ja": "直近のスケジュールは……っと。\n空いた時間に、レッスンルームの予約を……。", "zh": "最近的日程是……嗯。\n趁空闲时间预约一下练习室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "e411d1385cee48b92623107166c49000e35b673b9508552a1de4628e1c9dc242", "ja": "それにしても、来ないな……。\nまさか、事故に遭ったとかじゃないよね？", "zh": "话说回来，怎么还没来啊……\n该不会是遇到事故了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1050_027say", "source_sha256": "f99c2189102562a83c4e4a34d9354bf4eaaf82ef006bd8d73a999d52be81f281", "ja": "あっ、返信が来た！　ええと……？", "zh": "啊，回复来了！我看看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1051_null", "source_sha256": "9e43be4ea3ac0758b307ccc9f343bcb0d22c56f285e110fe0b487808241b41ff", "ja": "『紗代子、ゴメン！　寝坊しちゃった。今から\n出るけど、もう少しかかっちゃう……本当にゴメン！』", "zh": "『纱代子，对不起！我睡过头了。现在出门，不过还要再花点时间……真的对不起！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1052_027say", "source_sha256": "f3570322e43cd8d8abf84241400a5e96e0184f99938259b262b32007c33d4825", "ja": "あっ、なんだ。\nただの寝坊か、よかった。", "zh": "啊，原来只是这样。\n只是睡过头了啊，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1053_027say", "source_sha256": "e84f69be7f371c13f96dbb4df73dd4764117d0b954a9398fc4b4d638689fc34e", "ja": "『もう、心配したよ！　ちゃんと待ってるし\n急がなくていいから、ゆっくりおいでよ』……っと。", "zh": "『真是的，担心死我了！我会好好等着你，\n不用急，慢慢过来就好』……好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1054_narration", "source_sha256": "137997078aa6324645743469fbd19690d3ef1608df8260ab1cd47266ede438e0", "ja": "『少しも怒るそぶりを見せない高山さん。\nこれ、ヤラセじゃないです。ガチです』", "zh": "从未表现出一丝生气的高山小姐。\n这不是演的，是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1055_020meg", "source_sha256": "8202439d35816d86b80e921b19c740da8f6cefc97496a8da783970df0365e310", "ja": "いや……紗代子、流石にコレはおかしくない？\n1時間待たされたら、文句のひとつくらい言おうよ！", "zh": "不是……纱代子，这怎么看都很奇怪吧？\n都被人晾了1个小时，好歹也抱怨上一两句嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1056_023aka", "source_sha256": "61f1e11c112e2700eab4b7566527d3b01ad9d4442fddeee7c6cfcce1a5bc3b25", "ja": "紗代子ちゃん……！　心が広すぎて、\nちょっと怖くなるレベルなんだけど！　天使か！？", "zh": "纱代子……！心胸宽广到让人有点害怕的程度了！是天使吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1057_027say", "source_sha256": "2e8b740a6b8523f146481e83da11dbb3d77881e7564e69434f832c89a0793a04", "ja": "ええっ！？　でも、何か事情があるのかも\nしれないし……えっ、これって私がおかしいの？", "zh": "诶！？可是，说不定有什么苦衷……诶，难道是我不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0406_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_03_1058_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "df6cecfe8e2315b8f9eb4d02b017fb9923c524e8a0d066017154d4f232b3125e", "ja": "はい、というわけで、それぞれのドッキリをご覧\nいただきました！　見逃し配信は以下のURLから……", "zh": "好的，以上就是各个整蛊企划！想观看回放的话，请通过以下URL……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
